<title>ISRAEL: Tadiran Telecom wins $15 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Tadiran Telecom wins $15 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's Tadiran Telecommunications Ltd announced on Wednesday it had won a $15 million contract to supply its Tadigain communications system to Belgian telephone operator Belgacom SA.</p>
<p>The HDSL (high bit rate digital subscriber line) system enables the high-speed, broadband transmission of voice and data over existing copper wire networks.</p>
<p>Tadiran Telecommunications is a wholly owned subsidiary of Tadiran Ltd.</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
